COMPILATION OF: E52VH

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52VH

   1 a 0000 E52VH: procedure options(main);
   2 a 0006 
   3 a 0006    /* E2E-52/P3-9 probe VH (PLAN sec P3-9 H8): OR with ELSE.
   4 a 0006       The F2 slot must patch to the ELSE body; the THEN body
   5 a 0006       ends with the C3 over-else chain: two independent
   6 a 0006       targets, mirroring [C312]'s AND-with-else. */
   7 a 0006 
   8 c 0006    dcl dl fixed binary;
   9 c 0006    dcl x fixed bin;
  10 c 0006 
  11 c 0006    if dl < 0 | dl > 2 then x = 1;
  12 c 0020    else x = 2;
  13 c 0026    x = 3;
  14 c 002C 
  15 a 002C end E52VH;

CODE SIZE = 002F
DATA AREA = 0004
FREE SYMS = 38A4
END  COMPILATION
